	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Cache Checker Alfred Workflow

Check HTTP cache headers for any URL using a Cloudflare Worker.

### Setup (Required)

1. Open this workflow in Alfred Preferences
2. Click "Configure Workflow..." button (or right-click → Configure Workflow)
3. Enter your Worker URL and optional API key

### Usage

Type `cache` followed by a URL:
- `cache example.com`
- `cache https://wordpress.org`

### Output

- 🟢 All good - no errors or warnings
- 🟡 Has warnings - review recommended
- 🔴 Has errors - needs attention</string>
